Hello,

Follow-up on an open invoice for <%= @client&.name %>:
"<%= @agenda_item.title %>" — <%= number_to_currency(@invoice.amount) %> <%= @invoice.currency %>
Issued <%= @invoice.issued_at&.strftime("%B %d, %Y") %>.

<% if @invoice.external_url.present? -%>
Invoice link: <%= @invoice.external_url %>
<% end -%>

<% case @reminder_day %>
<% when 7 %>
If payment is already on the way, please disregard this message.
<% when 14 %>
Reply if you need a revised invoice or different payment instructions.
<% when 30 %>
Please let us know if anything is blocking payment so we can help.
<% end %>

Thank you,
<%= ENV.fetch("AGENCY_BILLING_SIGNATURE", "Your delivery team") %>
